Hi {Owner},

I build websites for florists around {City}. {Business Name} does beautiful floral work, but I couldn't find a site of your own where someone can order an arrangement for delivery or ask about wedding flowers.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: everyday and sympathy arrangements with same-day cutoffs, delivery zones, holiday pre-orders and a wedding page with your minimum and a consultation form, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, seasonal menus and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on a quiet afternoon?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
